        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cubiw Dungeron is a <strong>roguelike</strong> where you control a smiling cube that has to destroy more cubes inside the dungeon, while grabbing items that make you stronger to overcome the progressively tougher rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the complex, filled of multiple rooms, different every time you play, every 10 rooms you will fight against a boss, every 2 bosses, you go to the next area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-5 areas with 2 diferent paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-more than 70 different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-126 different items with unique variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More than 600 room combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more to come in the future</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Crazy Combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of chaos and progectiles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cubiw Dungeron is a <strong>roguelike</strong> where you control a smiling cube that has to destroy more cubes inside the dungeon, while grabbing items that make you stronger to overcome the progressively tougher rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the complex, filled of multiple rooms, different every time you play, every 10 rooms you will fight against a boss, every 2 bosses, you go to the next area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-5 areas with 2 diferent paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-more than 70 different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-126 different items with unique variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More than 600 room combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more to come in the future</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/32697817e7d04d79c05e6f2efc60cbd0.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Crazy Combos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/28fe5ef0b84de490c1c29892df235e7e.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of chaos and progectiles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.poster.avif?t=1778494633\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.webm?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/extras/5da3d79e85b0f95d713b968019624833.mp4?t=1778494633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
